  "Darwin\u2019s Ark release, Zenodo record 6522639, https://zenodo.org/records/6522639 (data/raw/zenodo: record_6522639.json, README.md, DarwinsArk.zip, CC0, checked against the md5 the record gives), with the six files argus_tick.py reads from the zip in data/raw/darwinsark.",
